  "html_content": "Subject: City Council Meeting\n\n# \u2709\ufe0f City Council Meeting\n*Your quick guide to what's on the City Council agenda \u2014 September 8, 2025*\n\n## \ud83d\udde3\ufe0f How to Participate\n- **Meeting:** [Monday, September 8 at 5:00 PM](https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=City%20Council%20Meeting&dates=20250908T170000/20250908T190000&location=West%20Side%20Branch%20Library%2C%20135%20Washington%20Avenue&details=City%20Council%20Meeting%20in%20Richmond) \ud83d\udcc5\n- **Where:** West Side Branch Library, 135 Washington Avenue\n- **Watch Online:** Not specified.\n- **Call In:** Not specified.\n- **Email Comments:** Not specified. \u2014 **deadline:** Not specified.\n- **Attend & Speak:** Check meeting agenda for public comment rules\n- **Full Agenda:** [View original meeting agenda](https://www.ci.richmond.ca.us/Calendar.aspx)\n\n## \ud83d\udea8 What's on the Agenda\n### Eviction Defense Lawyer @ West Side\n- **Change:** Are you a tenant facing eviction? Get a free 20-minute consultation at the West Side Branch from 5:00 to 7:00 PM.\n- **Impact:** Community engagement and civic participation.\n- **Action:** Contact the city for participation details.\n\n## \u2705 Bottom Line\nThis City Council meeting offers an opportunity for community engagement and participation. Attend in person or check the agenda for public comment rules.\n\n\u26a1 *Independent and nonpartisan summary. Facts only; no spin.*",
